<title>SWEDEN: Unibank to become market maker in Swedish T-bills.</title>
<headline>Unibank to become market maker in Swedish T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish bank Unibank will become a market maker of state treasury bills from December 4, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Unibank is already a market maker for Swedish state bonds.</p>
<p>The debt office now has 14 market makers in both state bonds and T-bills.</p>
<p>-- Barbara Taltavull, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1019</p>
